==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*gʷerH-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*gʷrātos}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro||*gʷr̥H-tó-s}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*gʷerH-||to welcome, greet, praise}}. 

Cognates include {{cog|sa|गृणाति|tr=gṛṇā́ti||to praise}} and {{m|sa|गूर्त|tr=gūrtá||pleasing, agreeable, welcome}}, {{cog|cu|жрьти}} and {{cog|prg|girtwei||to praise}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|grātus}}

===Adjective===
{{la-adj|grātus|comp=grātior|sup=grātissimus|adv=grātē}}

